    <task id="Id_22c184af-0881-49f4-be9f-0f175ebe931d" name="5.3.5 Establish the delivery team's mobilization plan">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o tem duas finalidades:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Ele informa a contratante sobre a abordagem da poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante em rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave; mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. &amp;Eacute; uma ferramenta para que a licitante planeje suficientemente sua fase de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para o gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ap&amp;oacute;s a nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pode assumir diferentes formas, por exemplo: um cronograma, uma tabela ou at&amp;eacute; mesmo um gr&amp;aacute;fico de Gantt. A norma ISO 19650-2 exige que a parte principal designada considere 11 elementos que abrangem testes de troca e fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, ambientes de dados comuns,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;outros requisitos de software e hardware e treinamento e educa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. O plano pode incluir:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Garantir que os formatos de arquivo de exporta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sejam consistentes e coerentes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Testar se as solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do ambiente comum de dados (CDE) da equipe de entrega funcionam conforme o esperado e se todas as partes designadas e equipes de tarefas podem acessar o CDE adequadamente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Testar se as solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de CDE do projeto funcionam conforme o esperado e se todas as partes importantes podem acess&amp;aacute;-las adequadamente. As solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de CDE do projeto tamb&amp;eacute;m devem oferecer suporte a todos os fluxos de trabalho de CDE, incluindo a garantia de que os mecanismos de aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o funcionem conforme o previsto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Testar como os cont&amp;ecirc;ineres de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem ser trocados manual ou automaticamente entre as solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, dependendo do fluxo de trabalho, para reduzir o tempo de espera da revis&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Assegurar que a infraestrutura de TIC do escrit&amp;oacute;rio local, incluindo as linhas de rede, esteja em vigor para permitir que a equipe local acesse as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Produzir planos ou guias de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para ajudar os usu&amp;aacute;rios a operar as solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es CDE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Orientar a equipe de entrega sobre as metas do projeto e a jornada para chegar l&amp;aacute;, al&amp;eacute;m de treinar a equipe de entrega sobre o uso de quaisquer solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es obrigat&amp;oacute;rias fornecidas pela contratante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Recrutamento de membros que desempenham um papel vital no gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, incluindo gerentes de documentos/design e consultores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Apoio a indiv&amp;iacute;duos e organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es que se juntam &amp;agrave; equipe de entrega durante a nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_cc03f0c9-f591-46f4-9c81-d855aa4ec821</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_84ab5d0c-8aaa-4eae-b486-fef1a8c0bc5e</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_35e1c40a-424a-486f-93e0-5c29f4b402e9">
        <dataOutput id="Id_7bb3903c-d4a3-49fb-b484-9eebea2775b5">
          <documentation />
          <dataState id="Id_971d8571-481e-4b70-8c53-3c91378a450b" />
        </dataOutput>
        <inputSet id="Id_d7325a57-a830-4e17-bfe4-ebefefda2619" />
        <outputSet id="Id_019e693c-2aab-49bb-a742-fbf42cbc3326">
          <dataOutputRefs>Id_7bb3903c-d4a3-49fb-b484-9eebea2775b5</dataOutputRefs>
        </outputSet>
      </ioSpecification>
      <dataOutputAssociation id="Id_1f341d53-702a-4184-b5ea-2302932109f8">
        <documentation />
        <sourceRef>Id_7bb3903c-d4a3-49fb-b484-9eebea2775b5</sourceRef>
        <targetRef>Id_b1531b34-f0ef-4783-9a9d-7b731014633f</targetRef>
      </dataOutputAssociation>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_b54188e6-71e7-4fe5-8235-e309941f9e8c" name="5.3.7 Compile the delivery team's tender response">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Consolidar todas as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias para responder ao convite de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o garantindo que contenha o BEP (pr&amp;eacute;-contratual); a compet&amp;ecirc;ncia e capacidade da equipe de entrega; a proposta do plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; e a gest&amp;atilde;o de riscos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
