    <task id="Id_79c42706-47cd-4b71-92c7-3c342c77bb99" name="5.3.3 Assess task team capability and capacity">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Cada equipe de trabalho dever&amp;aacute; considerar:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Compet&amp;ecirc;ncia e capacidade para gerenciar e produzir a infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM identifica o uso de um pacote de software espec&amp;iacute;fico para gerenciar informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Os membros da equipe de trabalho t&amp;ecirc;m experi&amp;ecirc;ncia em gerenciar suas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es usando esse software?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto descrevem v&amp;aacute;rios m&amp;eacute;todos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, incluindo conven&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de nomenclatura de espa&amp;ccedil;o, tipo de objeto e componente de objeto. Os membros da equipe de trabalho t&amp;ecirc;m experi&amp;ecirc;ncia em produzir suas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es seguindo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;esses m&amp;eacute;todos?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Disponiblidade de tecnologia da inofmra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: o hardware, o software e a infraestrutura de TI dispon&amp;iacute;veis para a equipe de trabalho podem atender &amp;agrave; estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es? Caso contr&amp;aacute;rio, a equipe de trabalho precisaria descrever como pretende atender &amp;agrave; estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; importante avaliar com precis&amp;atilde;o a capacidade e os recursos da equipe de trabalho e ser capaz de fornecer evid&amp;ecirc;ncias, se necess&amp;aacute;rio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span